# Third-party licence notices

This file was generated by [`cargo about`](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
from `Cargo.lock` by the release workflow (`.github/workflows/cli-release.yml`).
It lists every crate compiled into the `battlesnake` binary, grouped by
licence. Do not edit it by hand — it is regenerated for every release.

The first-party crates (`arena-api-scope`, `engine-core`, `rules`) and the CLI
itself are MIT, covered by this archive's `LICENSE`; they are also listed
below for completeness. Snake names shown by the CLI are covered by this
archive's `ATTRIBUTION.md`.

